-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Undo for worldforged-pickups.sql - removes exactly what it wrote.
--
-- Manual, and deliberately a deletion: this is the one place that removes rows from
-- gameobject_template, which the repository's SQL lint tells updates not to do. That is
-- why it is not under data/sql/db-world/, and why the migration writes the templates
-- with REPLACE INTO instead of deleting them first. Run it by hand against the world
-- database.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
